# S58 traverse: gas, and a moment later a part stick to the right with the gas held, so the bike meets
# the jump face ahead of the start at an angle and rides across it rather than up it. Wall-clock, at a
# quarter speed (4 ms here is 1 ms ridden).
sleep 4000
down cross
sleep 2000
stick l 0.4 0
sleep 22000
release
